{"query_id":"PQS_V1_Q007","gold_version":"DEVELOPMENT_INDEPENDENT_DRAFT_V1","required_aspects":[{"aspect_id":"Q007_A1","description":"项目地图提供项目目的、仓库结构与约束，帮助 Agent 快速定位上下文而不把全部细节塞入入口文件。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"项目地图"},{"aspect_id":"Q007_A2","description":"规格文档详细描述机制、视觉/功能目标和本版本交付物，可按主规格链接子模块规格。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"规格文档"},{"aspect_id":"Q007_A3","description":"验收标准必须具体可对照、尽量量化、明确判定方法，并要求提供测试通过证据。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"验收标准"},{"aspect_id":"Q007_A4","description":"三者协作形成从导航到目标细化再到可验证完成定义的闭环，并应把开发与测试/验收职责分离。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"应该怎样配合"}],"aspect_evidence_options":[{"aspect_id":"Q007_A1","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q007_A1_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q007_S1"]}]},{"aspect_id":"Q007_A2","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q007_A2_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q007_S2"]}]},{"aspect_id":"Q007_A3","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q007_A3_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q007_S3"]}]},{"aspect_id":"Q007_A4","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q007_A4_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q007_S1","Q007_S2","Q007_S3","Q007_S4"]}]}],"acceptable_evidence_groups_logic":"OR","acceptable_evidence_groups":[{"group_id":"Q007_G1","required_span_sets_within_group":"AND","required_span_sets":[{"set_id":"Q007_G1_MAP","required_span_ids":["Q007_S1"]},{"set_id":"Q007_G1_SPEC","required_span_ids":["Q007_S2"]},{"set_id":"Q007_G1_ACCEPT","required_span_ids":["Q007_S3"]},{"set_id":"Q007_G1_COORD","required_span_ids":["Q007_S4"]}]}],"span_registry":[{"span_id":"Q007_S1","video_id":"bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000016","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000017","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000018","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000019","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000020","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000021","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000022","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000023","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000024","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000025","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000026","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000027","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000028","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000029","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000030","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000031","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000032","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000033","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000034","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000035","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000036","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000037","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000038","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000039","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000040"],"start_time":41.4,"end_time":87.53,"quote_text":"第一步给AI建一张地图 放在项目根目录下的agents点MD就是这张地图 它的作用是让AI了解这个项目的整体情况 虽然现在的AI已经足够聪明 不给任何信息 他也能自己探索了解这个项目 但探索就会稍token 注意力也会被分散 所以关键信息一开始就要交出来 提供什么信息呢 最重要的两个 第一这个项目是做什么的 用一句话说清楚 比如说我们这里写了 用GODOT开发一个2D的小游戏 第二项目仓库的结构 也就是说明清楚代码资源 文件文档对应的是哪些文件夹 剩下其他的信息可以按需补充 比如说开发约束 也就是不能做什么 必须遵守哪些规则等等 注意不要把所有细节都塞进来 它只是目录 不是一份完整的说明书","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"2280150e5560bd13bd11895e02eb95b67c98f3054993776ca1ae7c1911f86686","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_ff4905367998957f27a4ccf81e8120781ccdeab11fc2db4f51ede6f58eb0a3eb","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q007_S2","video_id":"bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000041","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000042","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000043","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000044","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000045","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000046","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000047","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000048","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000049","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000050","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000051","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000052","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000053","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000054"],"start_time":87.53,"end_time":114.38,"quote_text":"第二步 把目标写到规格文档 这份文档一般放到spec文件夹下面 要写非常详细 比如在这个游戏项目中 我写清楚了游戏的机制是什么 视觉风格是什么样的 以及这个版本具体要交付哪些内容 如果要写的东西很多 可以拆分成两层 先写一个主规格文档 再从里面链接到其他子模块的文档 比如我这里就把规格文档拆分成了两个子文档 分别是游戏机制和视觉校验","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"2280150e5560bd13bd11895e02eb95b67c98f3054993776ca1ae7c1911f86686","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_ff4905367998957f27a4ccf81e8120781ccdeab11fc2db4f51ede6f58eb0a3eb","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q007_S3","video_id":"bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000055","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000056","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000057","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000058","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000059","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000060","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000061"],"start_time":114.38,"end_time":131.519,"quote_text":"最后一步是写一份验收标准 验收标准最重要的是具体能对照 比如能量化的地方直接给出具体数字 可能蒙混的地方一定要明确写出判定方法 还有一点特别重要 一定要让AI提供测试通过的证据 在源头上杜绝AI偷懒","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"2280150e5560bd13bd11895e02eb95b67c98f3054993776ca1ae7c1911f86686","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_ff4905367998957f27a4ccf81e8120781ccdeab11fc2db4f51ede6f58eb0a3eb","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q007_S4","video_id":"bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000100","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000101","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000102","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000103","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000104","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000105","bilibili:BV1hi7w6ME4Q:run_000:seg_000106"],"start_time":205.58,"end_time":223.32,"quote_text":"那最后来总结一下honeys engineering的关键 就是清晰的定义目标和验收标准 在交给不同的子弹里去执行 如果AI的产出结果不理想 我们应该先反思是不是没有跟AI交代清楚 而不是靠聊天来补救 这个就是驾驭工程和提示词工程最本质的区别","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"2280150e5560bd13bd11895e02eb95b67c98f3054993776ca1ae7c1911f86686","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_ff4905367998957f27a4ccf81e8120781ccdeab11fc2db4f51ede6f58eb0a3eb","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null}],"optional_context_spans":[],"source_review_state":{"authoritative_sources_reviewable":true,"full_authoritative_transcript_reviewed":true,"navigation_sources_used_as_gold_evidence":false},"review_state":"draft","reason_codes":["EG_COMPLETE_ACCEPTABLE_GROUP"],"builder_or_retrieval_output_limits_gold":false}
{"query_id":"PQS_V1_Q008","gold_version":"DEVELOPMENT_INDEPENDENT_DRAFT_V1","required_aspects":[{"aspect_id":"Q008_A1","description":"把模糊想法转为可理解、可开发、可验收的说明，减少开发中反复追问和边做边改。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"具体能减少哪些返工"},{"aspect_id":"Q008_A2","description":"提前对齐产品、设计、研发、测试、业务或人与 AI 的理解，减少各方按各自理解实现以及生成错误方向代码的返工。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"Vibe coding 前先写 PRD 或 Spec"},{"aspect_id":"Q008_A3","description":"提前明确背景、功能边界、业务规则、异常流程、模块拆分、实现步骤和验收标准，减少遗漏边界与后期重构。","materiality":"material","query_text_basis":"PRD 或 Spec 的作用"}],"aspect_evidence_options":[{"aspect_id":"Q008_A1","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q008_A1_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q008_S1"]}]},{"aspect_id":"Q008_A2","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q008_A2_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q008_S2"]}]},{"aspect_id":"Q008_A3","alternative_sets_between":"OR","required_spans_within_set":"AND","alternative_sets":[{"set_id":"Q008_A3_SET1","required_span_ids":["Q008_S3"]}]}],"acceptable_evidence_groups_logic":"OR","acceptable_evidence_groups":[{"group_id":"Q008_G1","required_span_sets_within_group":"AND","required_span_sets":[{"set_id":"Q008_G1_AMBIGUITY","required_span_ids":["Q008_S1"]},{"set_id":"Q008_G1_ALIGNMENT","required_span_ids":["Q008_S2"]},{"set_id":"Q008_G1_BOUNDARY","required_span_ids":["Q008_S3"]}]}],"span_registry":[{"span_id":"Q008_S1","video_id":"bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000024","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000025","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000026","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000027","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000028","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000029","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000030","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000031","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000032","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000033","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000034","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000035","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000036","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000037","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000038","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000039","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000040","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000041","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000042","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000043","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000044","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000045"],"start_time":42.133,"end_time":80.7,"quote_text":"PRD 本质上就是一个把模糊的产品想法 翻译成团队能理解 能开发能验收的一份说明书 比如说老板说我们要做一个会员系统 这句话听起来像是个需求 但其实呢 没办法直接开工 会员有几个等级 用户怎么开通 到期之后怎么办 退款怎么算 这些问题如果不提前说清楚 后面就会一边做一边问 然后一边问一边改 所以呢 PRD 真正解决的 是对齐理解的一个问题 以前呢我们说 PRD 很重要 是因为团队协作需要它 产品、设计、研发、测试、业务 大家必须先对齐一件事 否则呢 每个人都会按照自己的理解去做","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"03c2cdecf00a7066a975c9ac330424e43119e7bb4a9a029b8bd01974c0e593e4","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_e18409700314f5547ac6ad32f7622ecaaee38aa3a8d9cc5ed369bde838c6c861","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q008_S2","video_id":"bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000046","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000047","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000048","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000049","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000050","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000051","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000052","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000053","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000054","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000055"],"start_time":80.7,"end_time":99.1,"quote_text":"但现在 AI 编程越来越普及以后 我反而觉得 PRD 更重要了 因为 AI 写代码确实很快 但是呢它有一个前提 你得把需求说清楚 如果你只是跟 AI 说 帮我做一个会员系统 它当然也能生成一堆代码 但这些代码是不是你想要的 会员系统那就要打一个问号了","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"03c2cdecf00a7066a975c9ac330424e43119e7bb4a9a029b8bd01974c0e593e4","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_e18409700314f5547ac6ad32f7622ecaaee38aa3a8d9cc5ed369bde838c6c861","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null},{"span_id":"Q008_S3","video_id":"bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy","segment_ids":["bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000059","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000060","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000061","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000062","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000063","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000064","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000065","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000066","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000067","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000068","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000069","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000070","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000071","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000072","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000073","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000074","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000075","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000076","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000077","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000078","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000079","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000080","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000081","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000082","bilibili:BV1pUMh6JEmy:run_000:seg_000083"],"start_time":104.4,"end_time":147.133,"quote_text":"而现在我们只要把需求背景、功能边界、业务规则 验收标准等等 零零碎碎的想清楚 更完整的 PRD 可以交给 AI 然后帮咱们整理出来 比如说很多 AI 编程工具 都有类似 Plan 能力 我们先不着急让他们帮咱们写代码 而是先让他们帮咱们分析需求 拆解模块 梳理实现步骤 确认边界 这个过程 其实就是在和 AI 一起 去写一份面向开发的 PRD 但是呢这里有一个关键点 AI 可以帮我们表达 不能帮我们判断 它可以整理功能列表 补充异常流程 生成页面结构 甚至是拆分开发任务 但是呢这个功能该不该做 业务规则合不合理 这些判断最终还是要靠人的","source_language":"zh","source_type":"official_subtitle","source_version":"03c2cdecf00a7066a975c9ac330424e43119e7bb4a9a029b8bd01974c0e593e4","timeline_run_id":"timeline_run_e18409700314f5547ac6ad32f7622ecaaee38aa3a8d9cc5ed369bde838c6c861","segment_identity_version":"v3.5-source-identity-v2","source_quality_flag":"clean","translated_gloss":null}],"optional_context_spans":[],"source_review_state":{"authoritative_sources_reviewable":true,"full_authoritative_transcript_reviewed":true,"navigation_sources_used_as_gold_evidence":false},"review_state":"draft","reason_codes":["EG_COMPLETE_ACCEPTABLE_GROUP"],"builder_or_retrieval_output_limits_gold":false}
